<title>FINLAND: ARSENAL OY 1996 LOSS NARROWS TO FIM 1.4 BLN.</title>
<headline>ARSENAL OY 1996 LOSS NARROWS TO FIM 1.4 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-owned asset management company Arsenal Oy said in a statement on Thursday its loss narrowed to 1.4 billion markka in 1996 from a 5.3 billion markka loss the previous year.</p>
<p>The balance sheet total fell to 20.3 billion markka from 23.4 billion.</p>
<p>&quot;Arsenal expects its loss for 1997 to fall clearly from last year. The balance sheet total is expected to shrink to 17 billion markka,&quot; Arsenal said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
